          "english_quote": "“Listen also,” he said, “to the names of the women wearing black garments.",
          "issue": "The translation follows the selected working reading, but its notes do not disclose the supplied apparatus's distinction at this occurrence: ἱμάτια is attributed to Hilgenfeld's conjecture, compared with L₁, L₂ and E, whereas A reportedly reads ὀνόματα. Footnote [a] addresses the opening insertion, not this separate editorial choice in paragraph 3. Readers therefore cannot distinguish this conjectural working wording from the reported Athos reading.",
