          "issue": "“Dressed in black” faithfully represents the selected garments reading, but the simplified edition independently inherits an undisclosed editorial choice. The supplied apparatus reports ἱμάτια as Hilgenfeld's conjecture, compared with L₁, L₂ and E, and ὀνόματα as A's reading. Its opening note does not disclose this separate paragraph-3 locus.",
