          "english_quote": "The printed Athos-based text reconstructs the negative “would not” in damage.",
          "issue": "The simplified conditional preserves the source's necessity and negation, and [f] discloses the supplied negative. However, the note omits the supplied apparatus's additional distinction between Anger's conjectural γεγόνεισαν and the reported Athos γεγόνασι. This leaves a relevant editorial choice in the final predicate undisclosed.",
          "suggested_revision": "Extend [f] with an attributed, reader-accessible account of the conjectural working verb and the different verb form reported in A. Do not substitute the variant automatically or weaken “would not have been useful.” Submit any revised note or English wording for fresh review.",
